<title>FRANCE: Renault's Schweitzer new ACEA chairman.</title>
<headline>Renault's Schweitzer new ACEA chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renault Chairman Louis Schweitzer has been elected chairman of the European carmakers association ACEA for 1997, succeeding Jacques Calvet, chairman of PSA Peugeot Citroen, Renault said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said Schweitzer had been elected to the rotating chairmanship unanimously.</p>
<p>Renault is the smallest of the Big Six European carmakers.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
